The <a href="https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-ai/blob/main/models/spring-ai-mistral-ai/src/main/java/org/springframework/ai/mistralai/api/MistralAiApi.java">MistralAiApi</a> provides is lightweight Java client for <a href="https://docs.mistral.ai/api/">Mistral AI API</a>.

